Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["An introduction to interfacing to OpticStudio from Mathematica\n",
  FontSize->30],
 StyleBox["or",
  FontSize->24],
 StyleBox["\n",
  FontSize->30],
 StyleBox["How to build and optimize a singlet using ZOS-API with Mathematica",
  FontSize->24]
}], "Title",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6368300844166837`*^9, 3.6368301452879906`*^9}, 
   3.6374286407700815`*^9, {3.6379497954484234`*^9, 3.6379498353532934`*^9}, {
   3.6379578976582127`*^9, 3.6379578979546137`*^9}, 3.6380354392620125`*^9, {
   3.771519450121783*^9, 3.7715194798537827`*^9}, {3.771521194710183*^9, 
   3.771521199748584*^9}, {3.7715329418138003`*^9, 3.7715329444498005`*^9}, {
   3.771700639338005*^9, 3.7717006664316053`*^9}, {3.771700729002206*^9, 
   3.7717007380818057`*^9}, {3.771700786861406*^9, 3.771700790015206*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,
 FontSize->36,ExpressionUUID->"06efb047-f5a0-422c-af50-074237f899fb"],

Cell["written by David Keith", "Author",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.852566589149097*^9, 3.8525666209958906`*^9}},
 TextAlignment->Center,ExpressionUUID->"00862a23-5483-4352-a5d2-5f47e6f5abd3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["This article", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714279687736497`*^9, 
  3.77142797496585*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"cfb644fc-bb9b-4136-a603-\
50207192d1ec"],

Cell["\<\
This notebook is intended as an introduction to using ZOS-API to interface to \
OpticStudio from Mathematica. It is written as a Mathematica version of \
another knowledgebase article titled: \"How to build and optimize a singlet \
using ZOS-API with Python,\"  written by Thomas Aumeyr. (Thank you, Thomas!)  \
It follows that work step by step, and in fact copies much of the text \
explanations directly. This has been done so that an immediate comparison can \
be made between the ZOS-API syntax of Mathematica and Python. \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714278721016493`*^9, 3.7714279377604494`*^9}, {
   3.771519278040783*^9, 3.7715194165797825`*^9}, {3.771519740351783*^9, 
   3.7715197934387827`*^9}, {3.7715206885707827`*^9, 3.771520705232783*^9}, {
   3.7717004897120037`*^9, 3.7717005838754044`*^9}, {3.771700834563406*^9, 
   3.7717008540534062`*^9}, 3.7717013969052095`*^9, {3.8649272242468777`*^9, 
   3.864927227738783*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"21214dd7-9e9d-48c3-af68-\
f6af4e85966c"],

Cell["\<\
As in that article, we will design a singlet lens with the following \
specifications:\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 3.7714277670148487`*^9}, 
   3.7714278295744486`*^9, {3.7714279411754494`*^9, 
   3.77142795020805*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ccfb8e49-4a5b-4712-a672-\
6209e5e0cf83"],

Cell["\<\
Light comes from infinity, with a 5 degree semi-field of view, and a single \
wavelength (d-line, .587 mm)\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 3.7714277670148487`*^9}, 
   3.771427831366049*^9, {3.7715024853386*^9, 3.7715025091120005`*^9}, {
   3.7715027531926003`*^9, 
   3.7715027664054003`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"14a080ea-a0a0-41d4-affa-\
3e4e2a98fb27"],

Cell["\<\
Collimated input light is to be focused to smallest RMS spot size, averaged \
across the field of view\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 
  3.7714278011646485`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"a731d866-431f-4d94-a575-\
058e0e4bd1e9"],

Cell["F/10, EPD 40 mm", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 
  3.7714278059062486`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e424f01b-3e1b-4a5a-bc2f-\
b8118f0cd4cb"],

Cell["Made from N-BK7", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 3.771427810324049*^9}, {
  3.7715030110461016`*^9, 
  3.7715030139633017`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"85201a21-e4af-4722-877c-\
3b9e3aa28d34"],

Cell["\<\
Stop is a separate surface and is free to move but comes after the lens\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 
  3.771427814550249*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ac63a2bd-30f7-41cb-a24d-\
978148e87178"],

Cell["\<\
Lens should be at least 3, and no more than 15 mm thick at center\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 3.7714277605728483`*^9}, {
  3.771427790852248*^9, 
  3.7714278180608487`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"e26ea664-abbb-410a-9a00-\
a0009e898c50"],

Cell["\<\
Lens should have a minimum edge thickness of 3 mm, and air gaps should be a \
minimum of 0.5 mm\
\>", "Item",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7714277333524485`*^9, 3.7714277605728483`*^9}, 
   3.7714277956904488`*^9},ExpressionUUID->"aac62a4f-54ea-4d29-9311-\
0c420e6f4152"]
}, Open  ]],

