Cell["\<\

From this we can see that the full path is \
\[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]ZOSAPI.SystemData.WavelengthPreset.\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] We can use that to load the enumeration. This is \
passed to LoadNETType as a string in quotes.

Notice also that we can see the names of the various enumerated constants in \
the Help entry. These will be used as symbols, not as strings, so we need to \
observe the special translation of underscore to U when using them. We can \
also see the names of the enumerated constants by using NETTypeInfo, as seen \
below.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.771596532195243*^9, 3.771596771114044*^9}, 
   3.771596849470245*^9, {3.7716056827318983`*^9, 
   3.771605690842698*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7cca3cff-0d93-40d8-a61c-\
7916da3bc2ea"],

