Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Connect and create an application and a primary system", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.636223157780753*^9, 3.636223172196577*^9}, {
  3.6368200686644373`*^9, 3.6368200830412593`*^9}, {3.636827677911661*^9, 
  3.636827683850001*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"86a51aa7-1c18-4960-b4e5-\
6ed54e447ace"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "In this section we initialize the interface, make the connection to it from \
",
 StyleBox["Mathematica",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 ", and create an application, which is an instance of OpticStudio."
}], "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.6379542256245728`*^9, 3.6379542354369903`*^9}, {
