Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["And use it to set up the lens", "Section",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7715108510623465`*^9, 3.771510893541947*^9}, {
  3.7715109423713474`*^9, 
  3.771510942823747*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"0cb8540a-2660-4671-914d-\
1cbb0b6b9e51"],

Cell["\<\
In the LDE, each row represents a surface defined in the System: Surface 0 is \
the Object and the last Surface is the Image. For a simple lens located \
before the stop, the front side of the lens would be Surface 1, the rear side \
of the lens is Surface 2 and the Stop would be at Surface 3.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.771510915607747*^9, 
  3.771510917331547*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"5f0dcb45-1f7d-43e3-bb22-\
e7c0bda9489b"],

